  "body": "Share the default-color schema object across registered theme colors so each color no longer keeps its own identical copy. In a test that opened and closed an editor once, this removed 993 duplicate objects, saving 23.3 KiB of renderer memory.\n\n<br>\n\n<sub>AI disclosure: Model: gpt-6.1-sol. Worktime: 1 min</sub>\n\n",
  "rebaseable": false
 },
