   "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe narrow change preserves schema content, and no actionable findings remain.\n\n**No open issues** 🎉\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nReduces theme-color registry memory usage by sharing the identical default-color schema across registered colors.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Creates one default-color schema per registry.\n- Reuses it during color registration without changing schema content.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| src/​vs/​platform/​theme/​common/​colorUtils.ts | Shares the default-color schema instead of allocating it per color. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>",
